        <div class="cogstay-room-image" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566665797739-1674de7a421a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=85')">
            <span class="cogstay-room-badge">Available</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cogstay-room-body">
            <h3 class="cogstay-room-title">Deluxe Executive Room 302</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Double queen bedding configuration, balcony, coffee machine, desk.</p>
            <ul class="cogstay-room-amenities">
                <li class="cogstay-room-amenity"><i class="fa-solid fa-wifi"></i> Wifi</li>
